blurb = "Depicts a legend from the 17th century, in which a maid named Okiku breaks a valuable plate from a set of ten, and through several alternative versions of events ends up at the bottom of a well and turns into a ghost. The neighbors hear her voice from that well every night, repeating \"One, two, three... eight, nine. I can't find the last one...\"."
